   218	  <li>Branches: <code>git -C ~/my-clay-hub branch -a</code>, <code>git -C ~/studio-hub branch -a</code> (names start <code>phase-e-</code>); open PRs and their review state.</li>
   219	  <li>Deploy state: each project's <code>scripts/deploy-functions.sh --status --codebase &lt;cb&gt;</code> (fetch first).</li>
   220	  <li>Reviews: <code>~/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/reviews/my-clay-hub-phase-e-*</code>.</li>
