/Users/christiehubley/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/plans/firebase-functions-deploy-guard.html:517:<p>Full text is in <code>thoughts/reviews/firebase-functions-deploy-guard-round4-codex.md</code>. It confirms the receipt design is coherent, and that nearly every round-1 to round-3 item is genuinely resolved. Dispositions:</p>
