/Users/christiehubley/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/plans/clayhub-members-foundation.html:58:    <li>Phase E puts the first Cloud Functions in <code>tinker-hq-apps</code>. They sit outside the rules model, so they're contained by IAM.</li>
