/Users/christiehubley/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/plans/clayhub-members-foundation.html:77:  <li><strong>The link never forwards an event as it arrives.</strong> When anything changes, it <em>re-reads the current truth</em> for that member from <code>tinker-hq-apps</code> and sends a full snapshot stamped with the time it read it (D22). A later snapshot always wins. That makes deletes, email changes and events arriving out of order all safe.</li>
