/Users/christiehubley/tinker-ai-configs/thoughts/plans/clayhub-members-foundation.html:766:  <li><strong>Sep 28: ✅ Phase D complete</strong> (D-1, D-2, D-3, D-5; the Phase D plan's Decisions log is the record). The <code>my-clay-hub</code> project is live with deny-all Firestore + Storage rules, first deployed through its own guard at <code>2ad11ad</code> (receipts <code>deployed/my-clay-hub/firestore-rules/20260929T033845Z-2ad11ad</code>, <code>deployed/my-clay-hub/storage/20260929T034000Z-2ad11ad</code>; Console verified). <code>shared/denver-time.js</code> + <code>shared/derive-status.js</code> merged at <code>6a0233b</code> (Tinker-Art-Studio/my-clay-hub#1), reviewed by Codex + Claude. New decisions #56–59 (C6, C7, C8, and a pause with no end date → review). <strong>Next:</strong> Phase D2 (functions-aware deploy guard, its own plan), then D-4 (vault export), which gates Phase E's real member data.</li>
