589:  <li>The reconcile runs every 6 hours, and the status recompute daily at 3:30 AM.</li>
590:  <li>A reconcile that can't read the complete source changes nothing and alerts. A run that would change more than 10% of statuses, or remove more than 5% of members, stops and alerts.</li>
